Decision:
  - If (ii) < 0.1 and (i) ~ 0.29: active-active gain is the culprit.
    Fix via new qke_offdiag_gain_mode flag ('damping_only').
  - If (iii) < 0.1 and (ii) does not drop: need matched active-sterile
    gain; defer to Stage E.2(a-ii) for physics-motivated coupling.
  - If neither drops: hypothesis A falsified; hand off to B (window).
